"value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-23T10:33:49-07:00","id":1376275,"title":"","content":"&quot;Of course, commander. I did mean *all* of us when I said *us*&quot; West Sparrow replies. &quot;I am a bit winded, but I think I can move the old man. Does your medic think that's a feasible plan?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25845,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","user":"Arataya","date":". 03-23-2020, 01:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-23T11:43:17-07:00","id":1376282,"title":"","content":"&quot;I prefer not to let bullies off easy, however i would hate to see more good men fall,&quot; Replies BanFiz, not taking his eye off of the Dandy. &quot;I'm a creator not a fighter though so I will bow to others expertise.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-23T12:59:38-07:00","id":1376295,"title":"","content":"The soldier tending to the old man's injuries shouts a report back. <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;The old man's bleeding internally, but nothing's broken. Moving him won't make him worse.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose