mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-01T11:07:42-07:00","id":1377764,"title":"","content":"&quot;Are you kidding me???&quot; West Sparrow's incredulity has given him his breath again. &quot;You were supposed to cover <b>me</b>, not run for cover yourself!&quot; he mutters at Ethan's retreating form. His logical side knows it was the smart move on Ethan's part, but the slashing sword in his face means his emotional side is doing the talking. &quot;Always gotta be the heroic one, don't you, West.&quot; With the old Exalted still on his back, West Sparrow turns towards the Captain, blade up. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Parry is 5, plus 1 for stunt, plus spending 4 motes (melee excellency) to add 2 more for a total of 8 Defense. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-01T12:14:04-07:00","id":1377777,"title":"","content":"Banfiz pulls another vial out of his pocket to reload. Realizing he needs to do something now and doesn't have time to reload he creates a lit firestarter like he uses with the forge. &quot;I'll keep this one busy so you can get out West he shouts&quot; &quot;I hope this works,&quot; He mutters to him self. Then flings the vial and firestarter at the Gunslinger, and moves towards West.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><u><a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/795811\" target=\"_blank\">https://orokos.com/roll/795811</a> Throwing Shade</u>: <u>17d10x7</u> <b>11</b><br /> Using <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#1D1C1D\"><span style=\"font-family:Slack-Lato\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Precision of the Striking Raptor and Buying 2 dice</span></span></span></div></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25821,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","user":"Magesrook","date":". 04-01-2020, 03:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-01T17:16:19-07:00","id":1377826,"title":"","content":"The firedust impacts where the gunslinger had been standing, a small ball of flame spreading out around it, but the gunslinger lunged out of the way between one breath and the next, his preternaturally fast steps getting him well clear.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> The gunslinger spends 4 motes on the Dodge Excellency, one mote on Drifting Leaf Elusion, and 6 points of Initiative on Reed In The Wind.<br /> Evasion 5 + 1 Stunt + 2 Excellency + 3 Reed In The Wind = 11 and Drifting Leaf Elusion breaks the tie in his favor.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-03T09:05:39-07:00","id":1378279,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow's blade blocks the captain's, and he shoves her away, giving himself and the old man a bit of space. After watching the captain go toe to toe with Ethan, he knows that sticking around, while an exciting idea, is not a good one. With a deep anchoring breath, he crouches down and then <i>jumps</i>, twisting so he can catch the lip of the roof behind him. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> roll to disengage: dex 4 plus doge 2 plus 6 dice for the doge excellency (spending 6 motes) plus 2 stunt dice for a total of 14 dice. <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/796090\" target=\"_blank\">Disengage from Captain and Bloody Knuckles</a>: <u>12d10x7</u> <b>6</b> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/796091\" target=\"_blank\">2 stunt dice for disengage</a>: <u>2d10x7</u> <b>0</b> also spending willpower to get a total of 7 successes. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25845,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","user":"Arataya","date":". 04-03-2020, 05:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-03T15:27:12-07:00","id":1378372,"title":"","content":"The captain lunges for West Sparrow, hand grasping for a hold on his arm, his clothes, anything, but catches only the wind of his passing. The brawler dives for the old man, hoping to wrest him from the swashbuckler's grip, but narrowly misses.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/796127\" target=\"_blank\">Opposing Disengage</a>: <u>8d10x7</u> <b>3</b><br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/796135\" target=\"_blank\">Opposing Disengage</a>: <u>6d10x7</u> <b>6</b><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The gunslinger jumps down from the rooftops to join the other two Abyssals as they all chase after the fleeing group.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Since everyone is now running away and/or chasing someone, I think now is a good moment to switch out of normal combat movement and try to resolve this using the rules for extended actions.<br /> Everyone will make Dexterity + Athletics rolls - one a round - as you run for the docks. If you stunt something that should cause your pursuers trouble, that will apply a penalty to them and vice-versa. Whichever group has the most successes after six rolls wins - either you get to the docks ahead of them or else they catch you and are able to re-engage near the docks.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-03T16:51:10-07:00","id":1378400,"title":"","content":"Leaping from the alley that runs alongside the shop he hid in, Ethan lands in stride beside West Sparrow.<br /> &quot;If we can get close enough, my ship can aid us,&quot; he calls. &quot;The marines who fell back ahead of us will have alerted my crew!&quot;<br /> With a glance and effort of will, a strand of his anima settles in a fine mist of water across the cobblestones behind them as they take the first tight turn on the way down towards the docks.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <d