d assuming Mizuchi is a ship of some sort, West Sparrow streaks across the roof, instinctively balancing on the lip of the roof like it's a rope on a ship. He jumps, easily clearing the gap between the buildings, and heads towards the docks. As he leaps from roof top to roof top with lightning speed, golden wisps of anima trail in his wake, gently coiling around the Exalted on his back. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Dex 4 + Ath 3 + jumping speciality 1 + stunt 2 = 10 dice. Spending 3 motes on lightning speed to get one auto success and to reroll 5s and 6s until they fail to appear. <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/796550\" target=\"_blank\">Running to the docks</a>: <u>10d10x7</u> <b>9</b> (no 5s or 6s to reroll, so 10 total successes.) Also spending 3 motes on Graceful Crane Stance, and 2 motes on monkey leap technique Also, I spent 8 motes of peripheral essence, so I am at glowing anima level. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25845,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","user":"Arataya","date":".  Forgot to add in the auto success to the total. 04-05-2020, 10:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T11:28:54-07:00","id":1379024,"title":"","content":"Having been abandoned by his would be allies, BanFiz ducks down a different alley. He will hopes the enemy will follow the other two and the old man as he tries to find another way to the docks.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><u><a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/796679\" target=\"_blank\">https://orokos.com/roll/796679</a></u>Run Away: <u>7d10x7</u> <b>2</b></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25821,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","user":"Magesrook","date":". 04-06-2020, 02:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-08T16:54:03-07:00","id":1379552,"title":"","content":"Ethan's ingenious trick of slicking the cobblestones with water produces unexpected and disastrous results as lightning strikes down from the storm clouds above and arcs through the puddles left behind, crackling across Ethan before finally grounding itself.<br /> <br /> The gunslinger bounds up to the rooftops, chasing directly after West Sparrow with graceful measured strides and soaring leaps, drifting, gray-glowing feathers taking shape in his wake.<br /> The other Abyssals pursue along the street level, following behind Ethan. Their feet splash through the pooled water, forcing them to slow somewhat to avoid slipping.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> I need a Stamina + Resistance roll from Ethan to resist an environmental hazard with Difficulty 4 and a damage of 4L.<br /> <br /> The gunslinger activates Graceful Crane Stance, Monkey Leap Technique, and buys 5 dice with the Athletics Excellency.<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/797258\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>15d10x7</u> <b>5</b><br /> The captain buys 5 dice with the Athletics Excellency as well, but takes a -2 penalty for the water.<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/797259\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>11d10x7</u> <b>4</b><br /> The brawler will buy 5 dice, suffers the same -2 penalty, and is still dealing with the wound penalty.<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/797261\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>9d10x7</u> <b>5</b><br /> <br /> That puts the Abyssals at a sum of 14 successes so far vs your 14 successes.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":74,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","user":"Kyeudo","date":". 04-15-2020, 08:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-09T10:04:31-07:00","id":1379790,"title":"","content":"Having found a parallel path other the other side of the shops BanFiz races to keep up, checking his progress at every cross street.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><u><a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/797680]\" target=\"_blank\">https://orokos.com/roll/797680</a></u>More Running: <u>7d10x7</u> <b>3</b></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25821,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","user":"Magesrook","date":". 04-10-2020, 11:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-10T22:27:50-07:00","id":1380318,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow notices the gunslinger behind him. Not wanting to be anywhere in range of the man's firewand, he pushes himself even harder, sprinting as fast as he can, throwing himself across rooftops at a nearly reckless pace. He notices one rooftop that is taller than the rest, probably a temple. He jumps up to the dome and hides behind it for a moment, watching the gunslinger's movements while pulling out his knife. . When the gunslinger looks down to aim his jump, West Sparrow quickly slides down the side of the building, using the knife to slow his movement down the clay brick wall. Wincing slightly at the damage he is doing to an unidentified god's house of worship, he slips the knife back into its sheath. &quot;I was so looking forward to a drink tonight too.&quot; He sighs, as he flicks nearly all the coins he has into an open window of the temple. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Dex 4 + Athletics 3 + Jumping specialty 1 + stunt 2 = 10 dice Also spending 1 mote to keep Monkey Leap Technique active (Graceful Crane Stance remains active for a whole scene, so that is also still in affect).Spending 3 motes on lightning speed to get one auto success and to reroll 5s and 6s until they fail to appear. <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/797822\" target=\"_blank\">Continuing to run for the docks</a>: <u>10d10x7</u> <b>3</b> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/797823\" target=\"_blank\">Reroll 5/6s</a>: <u>3d10x7</u> <b>2</b> plus the auto success plus the auto success for the level 2 stunt is 7 total successes </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25845,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","user":"Arataya","date":".  Adding in the auto success from Kyle deciding that I did a level two stunt. 04-13-2020, 12:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-14T11:16:57-07:00","id":1381380,"title":"","content":"Smelling ozone, his weather senses honed from years at sea Ethan raises one of his punch knives into the air to receive the coming lightning strike. With an effort he wills a cable of flexing water to connect the steel of the raised blade to the blade in his other hand, which he drags through the pooling water he is leaving behind, hoping to send a nasty surprise to his pursuers. Grunting with the effort and the pain of the strike, he pushes through, forcing his muscles to move past their painful spasming, continuing to race down the street.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> 1 mote spent for the use of water aspect (8/13 personal, 21/31 peripheral, 3 of 13 personal are committed)<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/798987#\" target=\"_blank\">8d10x7</a> = 2<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25822,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","user":"Mizuchi","date":". 04-14-2020, 02:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-14T20:19:01-07:00","id":1381515,"title":"","content":"The lightning leaves Ethan slightly scorched.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/799186\" target=\"_blank\">Environmental Damage</a>: <u>4d10t7</u> <b>1</b><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/