tNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/799374\" target=\"_blank\">8d10x7: 5</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-18T22:09:48-07:00","id":1382443,"title":"","content":"The gunslinger pauses atop the shrine, surveying for West Sparrow. Only a few heartbeats pass before he spots the fleeing Solar's glowing anima disappearing around the corner of a building, but West Sparrow doesn't waste them, growing the gap between himself and his pursuer. The gunslinger leaps after him, cutting across rooftops to narrow the distance.<br /> <br /> Jolted back to semi-consciousness by the slide to the ground, the Exalt stirs on West Sparrow's shoulder. He digs into a pocket, pulling out a scrap of cloth, and presses it into the Solar's hand, <span style=\"color:goldenrod\">&quot;Don't . . . let . . . them . . . take . . . it.&quot;</span> he wheezes.<br /> <br /> The captain and the dandy set a dogged pace behind Ethan, pushing the Terrestrial hard with seeming inexhaustible endurance.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Everyone gets 5 motes back.<br /> <br /> The gunslinger is spending a mote on Monkey Leap Technique and 5 motes on the Athletics Excellency.<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/800491\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>15d10x7</u> <b>3</b><br /> <br /> The captain is spending 5 motes on the Athletics Excellency<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/800490\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>13d10x7</u> <b>13</b><br /> <br /> The brawler is spending 5 motes on the Athletics Excellency<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/800492\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>11d10x7</u> <b>8</b><br /> <br /> This puts the Abyssals at 38 successes to your 29 successes. They are gaining on you, primarily due to that huge number of 10s the captain just rolled.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":74,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","user":"Kyeudo","date":". 04-22-2020, 12:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-20T10:18:01-07:00","id":1382787,"title":"","content":"BanFiz seeing Ethan is losing ground redoubles his effort. &quot;I'm getting to old for this,&quot; he mutters to himself. He knows though if Ethan needs help he needs to be in position to give it.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><u><a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/801018\" target=\"_blank\">https://orokos.com/roll/801018</a></u> : Gotta Help Ethan : <u>7d10x7</u> <b>5</b></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-21T21:18:01-07:00","id":1383083,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow instinctively takes the proffered scrap of cloth, quickly shoves it in a pocket, and just as quickly grabs the old man's hands again, before the Exalt slides off his back. Knowing that his glowing anima banner is going to make stealth difficult, if not impossible, West Sparrow opts for speed and directness instead, Pushing himself, he continues his sprint down the streets toward the docks, muttering to himself &quot;I hope that captain character shows up soon; not much help to run to his ship if I can't pick it out from all the other ships....&quot; <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Dex 4 +Ath 3 + stunt 2 = 10 base dice. Spending 3 motes on lightening speed to get one auto success and to reroll 5s and 6s until they fail to appear. Still have Graceful Crane Stance turned on (as it lasts a whole scene) but I'm not going to pour any more motes into maintaining monkey leap technique. <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/801501\" target=\"_blank\">Running to the Docks, Still</a>: <u>10d10x7</u> <b>5</b> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/801502\" target=\"_blank\">Reroll of 5s/6s for Running to the Docks, Still roll</a>: <u>3d10x7</u> <b>1</b> 6 dice successes, plus the auto success, for a total of 7 successes. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T12:36:41-07:00","id":1384476,"title":"","content":"Feet pounding pavement on the way down to the quayside, Ethan wished it didn't feel quite so familiar. He found the Mizuchi easily in the waters below, a shining beacon of gleaming metal with roaring guns speaking out against the invaders. His practiced eye could see his marines swiftly swimming across the open water and climbing back aboard. Moments after the first made it aboard, the ship adjusted gracefully and the Mizuchi's screws shifted water towards the docks.<br /> <br /> Glancing back at the Abyssals closing the gap behind him, and knowing he was dead last of his own party of makeshift allies, he put his crew's tried and true plan into action.<br /> <br /> &quot;Look there!&quot; Ethan bellowed back over his shoulder, pointing dramatically to the sea. &quot;You've more than one ship missing or burning to the waterline thanks to my crew. Soon you may have no way off the island, and still you pursue a revered elder and well intentioned passerby?&quot; Even as he ran, the Mizuchi's captain laughed uproariously, slapping his thighs, his banner anima growing brighter and brighter with each slap. &quot;And my crew calls me crazy!&quot;<br /> <br /> Still running Ethan waves his glowing arms overhead, indicating the Abyssals behind him to the sharp eyes of his first mate. Even at this distance Ethan could practically hear the curses the man was sure to be spewing alongside orders to their crew.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> 4 presence, 3 manipulation, 2 stunt = 9 dice + spending 6 peripheral motes (burning aura) for 3 successes with Glowing Coal Radiance<br /> 8/13 personal, 16/31 peripheral<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/803101\" target=\"_blank\">9d10x7+3 = 8</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-29T11:57:15-07:00","id":1384677,"title":"","content":"The gunslinger crisscrosses the street behind West Sparrow, leaping from rooftop to rooftop as he tries to get within range of the Solar. The two other Abyssals, feet pounding upon the cobblestones, continue their pursuit of Ethan, though the scowl upon the captain's features deepens as he mentions their lost ships.<br /> <br /> Out in the harbor, however, things aren't going quite as well as Ethan portrayed them. Between the Mizuchi's fire and the pounding of the harbor cannon from the fort above, the enemy ships have taken losses, but most of the docked ships are ablaze and the fire is spreading to some of the waterfront buildings. As Ethan watches, a figure on the deck of one of the ships conjures shards of bone from thin air, which hurtle with great speed and force into the side of the Mizuchi, some embedding themselves into the jade-steel hull.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> For those not counting, this is roll 3 of 6.<br /> <br /> Everyone gets 5 motes back.<br /> <br /> I forgot to take some dice off the gunslinger's roll last time, so I'll just take that off now. The gunslinger is going to spend another mote on Monkey Leap Technique and three motes on the Athletics Excellency.<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/803306\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>11d10x7</u> <b>9</b><br /> <br /> The captain will spend 4 motes on the Athletics Excellency.<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/803309\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>12d10x7</u> <b>4</b><br /> <br /> The brawler will spend 4 motes on the Athletics Excellency.<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/803308\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>9d10x7</u> <b>8</b><br /> <br /> That puts the Abyssals at 59 successes to your 53 successes. I finally remembered to add in the successes from AJ's forgotten stunt dice, which helped make the Abyssals lead a little smaller.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-05T16:16:32-07:00","id":1385962,"title":"","content":"Knowing the time for desperate action has come, Ethan churns his legs harder than he has in, well, days, but it still feels too hard. He yearns for the calming presence of the ocean around him and the Mizuchi's decks underfoot rather than the tough stone.<br /> <br /> As he and the Mizuchi close, both drawing ever nearer the quay, he calls out his orders. The distance is great, but he trusts the sailors to hear them through the ongoing fight and stormy weather, as they have many times before. Regardless, he adds a little extra emphasis using the peculiar bond they share, their prey draws near.<br /> <br /> &quot;Open fire!&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/804870\" target=\"_blank\">Contest roll 8d10x7: 3</a><br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/804872\" target=\"_blank\">Command/Order roll 14d10x7: 7</a><br /> paid 3 motes (personal) for tactics mean everything (3 more dice, reroll sixes)<br /> 3 motes (peripheral) for Feeding Frenzy Call (I'd argue it applies, I'm just asking for ranged support here. How many dice would I add? Or any? I rolled without)<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/804998\" target=\"_blank\">2d10x7, plus reroll a 6: 0</a><br /> 10 personal<br /> 13 peripheral<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25822,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","user":"Mizuchi","date":". 05-06-2020, 11:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-11T11:23:22-07:00","id":1387547,"title":"","content":"Seeing the scene of carnage they have run to Banfiz thinks to himself. &quot;This is starting to look like we may have made matters worse.&quot; Since they are close enough to the docks he begins to plan resuming his attack while he continues to race to the ship.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><u><a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/805961\" target=\"_blank\">https://orokos.com/roll/805961</a></u>: <u>7d10x7</u> <b>4</b></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-11T17:54:36-07:00","id":1387621,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow watches as one of the ships fires up towards where he hopes his companions last were, or rather where the pursuers of his companions were. Taking the shot as evidence of Ethan's ownership, West continues running down the docks, heading toward where the ship looks like it is going to come to a stop. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Dex 4 +Ath 3 + stunt 2 = 10 base dice. Spending 3 motes on lightening speed to get one auto success and to reroll 5s and 6s until they fail to appear. Still have Graceful Crane Stance turned on (as it lasts a whole scene) Also spending 2 motes on Athletic excellency. Total dice is 12. <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/806020\" target=\"_blank\">More running to the docks</a>: <u>12d10x7</u> <b>8</b> Reroll of 5s and 6s: <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/806022\" target=\"_blank\">reroll of dice from last roll</a>: <u>2d10x7</u> <b>0</b> So 8 success plus the one auto success is 9 total successes. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T21:04:03-07:00","id":1388551,"title":"","content":"The Mizuchi cuts through the water, pivoting to bring a full broadside to bear. The dragon cannons roar, lances of fire streaming up into the city to wash across the streets behind Ethan. The Abyssals split up to avoid the barrage, crashing through buildings to use as cover, trying to keep up their pursuit.<br /> <br /> The gunslinger cuts across the roof of a corner building, angling to get ahead of West Sparrow and cut off his escape.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Roll 4 of 6. Everyone gets 5 motes back.<br /> <br /> The captain spends 5 motes on not getting blown up.<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/806846\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>8d10x7</u> <b>2</b><br /> <br /> The brawler spends 5 motes on not getting blown up.<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/806847\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>6d10x7</u> <b>3</b><br /> <br /> The gunslinger spends a mote on Monkey Leap Technique and three motes on the Athletics Excellency<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/806848\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>13d10x7</u> <b>6</b><br /> <br /> This puts the Abyssals at 70 successes to your 69 successes.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-19T06:59:19-07:00","id":1389959,"title":"","content":"Banfiz Is in awe of the flames he see's arching to the other street. Realizing he wont have time to aim takes a vial out of his pocket to throw when he next sees an opponent, Theres bound to be some fire he can throw it in. Just in case he sties a slow match to the vial. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <u><a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/807662\" target=\"_blank\">https://orokos.com/roll/807662</a> : Runnin Runnin</u>: <u>7d10x7</u> <b>4</b> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-22T10:37:25-07:00","id":1390807,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow tightens his grip on the old man, and keeps his eyes on the rooftops. Spotting the gunslinger, West quickly decides the docks are <i>not</i> the best way to get to the ship. Straightening his back and rolling his shoulders, he changes his direction, aiming himself in the straight line that is the shortest distance between him and it, disregarding the minor inconvenience the lack of solid surfaces might provide. &quot;Come on, old man, hold on just a little longer. Help is nearly within reach.&quot; <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Dex 4 +Ath 3 + stunt 2 = 10 base dice. Spending 3 motes on lightening speed to get one auto success and to reroll 5s and 6s until they fail to appear. Still have Graceful Crane Stance turned on (as it lasts a whole scene). Also spending 3 motes on Feather Foot Style, to run across fluid surfaces--this charm is mute, so even though I'm spending 6 motes this turn, I'm not going to move up the anima banner ladder. <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/808832\" target=\"_blank\">Running across the bay toward the ship</a>: <u>10d10x7</u> <b>4</b> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/808834\" target=\"_blank\">Reroll of 5/6s for running to the ship</a>: <u>2d10x7</u> <b>1</b> 4+1+1 auto = 6 total success</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T09:11:34-07:00","id":1391961,"title":"","content":"The warmth of the shots flying over his head is a familiar comfort to Ethan, and he settles into make the final sprint to the Mizuchi, trusting his privateers to cover him and his companions. He spares one last glance in the last direction he saw each of his companions, ready to help them to the relative safety of the ship across the water, though he suspects they are more than capable of making their way across the bay.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/810058\" target=\"_blank\">8d10x7: 4</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-02T16:50:38-07:00","id":1393713,"title":"","content":"The Mizuchi's cannon roar again, raining fire into the harbor district in an attempt to exterminate the Abyssals pursuing Ethan, but without the element of surprise and Ethan's precision spotting succeed only in setting buildings ablaze. The captain leaps out of a window, splintering the shutters, and rolls to her feet on the street behind Ethan and begins to make up the ground lost to the cannonade. The brawler kicks open the door of the building he took shelter in, the thatch roof burning hungrily, and rejoins the chase as well. The sea fort's cannon booms again, but this time the iron ball hammers into the Mizuchi's plating.<br /> <br /> The gunslinger leaps out onto the pier, feet flying from the top of one pile to the next, the leaps again onto the prow of a moored ship, its sails and rigging aflame. He dashes down the length of the vessel to the stern, obviously aiming to get close enough to tackle West Sparrow.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Roll 5 of 6. Only one more to go. Everyone gets 5 motes back.<br /> <br /> The gunslinger spends 1 mote on Monkey Leap Technique and 3 motes on the Athletics Excellency.<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/811925\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>13d10x7</u> <b>9</b><br /> <br /> The captain spends 4 motes on the Athletics Excellency<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/811926\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>12d10x7</u> <b>3</b><br /> <br /> The brawler spends 4 motes on the Athletics Excellency<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/811928\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>10d10x7</u> <b>4</b><br /> <br /> This puts the Abyssals at 86 successes to your 83 successes.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-18T17:27:11-07:00","id":1397405,"title":"","content":"West Sparrows keen ears pick up the sound of boots on a ship, and a roar of fury flies from his mouth. &quot;I haven't come this far, just to fail now.&quot; he screams. He jumps in a zig-zag pattern, dodging away from the flaming boat. &quot;I am a leaf on the wind, watch me soar!&quot; He channels every ounce of power and will he has left, rushing as fast as a albatross in a dive. His anima burns brighter, adding a different light to the flames in the harbor,. The light trails behind him, sliding through the waves that splash into his wake. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Dex 4 +Ath 3 + stunt 2 = 10 base dice. Spending 3 motes on lightening speed to get one auto success and to reroll 5s and 6s until they fail to appear. Still have Graceful Crane Stance turned on (as it lasts a whole scene) as well as Feather Foot Style (as it lasts until I stop running). Spending 7 motes on the Athletics Excellency, and a point of willpower for another automatic success. Anima banner is now at burning level. 17 total dice. <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/816643\" target=\"_blank\">Running across the harbor</a>: <u>17d10x7</u> <b>2</b> Rerolling 5s and 6s: <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/816645\" target=\"_blank\">Reroll Running to Harbor</a>: <u>5d10x7</u> <b>1</b> Reroll of 5s and 6s again: <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/816647\" target=\"_blank\">Re-reroll of running in harbor</a>: <u>2d10x7</u> <b>0</b> plus 2 auto successes = 5 total successes. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-19T22:59:53-07:00","id":1397628,"title":"","content":"Shouting in joy and relief as he nears the water, Ethan points towards West Sparrow and the elderly Banfiz and bellows across the short expanse of rippling bay, &quot;We have their backs, cover them!&quot;<br /> <br /> He then arcs in a clean dive to break through the surface of the water, his anima and own unique ties to the sea propelling him as though he were a sea dragon, the black jade of Uminchu sparkling in the glow of his anima banner. The Mizuchi is at hand, its sailors and marines answering the call, and so too does Mizuchi herself, sliding silently beneath him, a darkness only distinguishable to even his eyes in the flash and flicker of the ships' cannons and marines firewands just overhead. The young dragon blooded traces his fingers along his familiar's flank, baring his teeth in a feral grin. His pursuers know not what they chase, or that hunter will momentarily become hunted.<br /> <br /> Having made his will known to the rest of his school, Ethan arcs up again towards the surface, to prepare his ship for an immediate departure, and an immediate dive.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <b>Contest roll: <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/816954\" target=\"_blank\">8d10x7+1: </a>4 (one more from spent willpower) </b><br /> 3 motes Tactics Mean Everything, 3 motes Feeding Frenzy (adding two dice like before), all 6 are personal motes<br /> <b>Command roll/marine/ship contest roll: <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/816955\" target=\"_blank\">16d10x7: 8</a> </b>(no 6s to reroll)<br /> <b>Mizuchi</b>: Prepares to grapple the first enemy passing over her to pull back beneath the water, depth lurker means she can be at &quot;long range&quot; and may rush... We also never settled on how exactly she is &quot;magical or extraordinary&quot; mechanically. For now I'll roll the 8d10x7 grapple, you can tell me if I should do something else: <b><a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/816956\" target=\"_blank\">8d10x7+1: </a>7 (one more from a spent willpower)</b><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25822,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","user":"Mizuchi","date":". 06-23-2020, 02:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-23T09:29:34-07:00","id":1398374,"title":"","content":"BanFiz surveys the carnage around him. He see's his companions fleeing towards Mizuchi and knows he needs to do something to catch up. He sprints towards the dock with the best line to reach the ship and pulls out his firewand. Talking to himself and hoping the goddess might here him, &quot;If this works I will pay a tribute to Luranume&quot;. Knowing he needs to time the perfectly he leaps from the dock pointing his firewand behind him. As he nears the top of his ark he pulls the trigger hoping the flames will provide the additional momentum and allow him to complete the jump successfully.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <u><a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/818056\" target=\"_blank\">https://orokos.com/roll/818056</a> Rocket Man </u>: <u>12d10x7</u> <b>7 </b><br /> <br /> I somehow buy or talk Kyle into an additional 5 dice beyond basic stunt.<br /> <br /> Spend willpower for 1 success.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25821,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","user":"Magesrook","date":". 06-23-2020, 01:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-23T16:36:45-07:00","id":1398458,"title":"","content":"The gunslinger fires upon the mast of the ship, the blast of green flame eating away at the already weakened wood. The mast snaps under its own weight with a loud crack and begins to fall towards the bow. The Abyssal leaps upwards, catching hold of the mast and using its falling mass to catapult himself out over the bay, aiming to tackle West Sparrow. As the gunslinger flies towards the Solar, Mizuchi bursts upward out of the water and seizes the man's leg in her fanged maw, dragging him down into the water with her. The Abyssal rapidly frees himself, bashing the sea serpent repeatedly with the butt of his flame piece, but West Sparrow is past him before he can recover.<br /> <br /> The ship's dragon cannons belch fire again, bombarding the other Abyssals. The blaze engulfs the brawler, throwing him back into a building and burying him beneath burning rubble. He digs himself out, scorched but alive, and continues to push forward. The captain, however, meets the flames head on, her sword carving apart the torrent and deflecting it around her. She continues to charge towards the Mizuchi as BanFiz rockets from one of the piers, managing to crash land upon the deck of the ship.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Roll 6 of 6. Time to find out what happens next.<br /> <br /> The gunslinger spends 1 mote on Monkey Leap Technique, 4 motes on the Martial Arts Excellency minimizing Mizuchi's grapple on him.<br /> <br /> The captain spends 4 motes on defending herself.<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/818164\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>6d10x7</u> <b>4</b><br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/818166\" target=\"_blank\">Forgotten Stunt</a>: <u>2d10x7</u> <b>2</b><br /> <br /> The brawler spends his motes on defending himself.<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/818165\" target=\"_blank\">Chasing</a>: <u>6d10x7</u> <b>1</b><br /> <br /> This puts the Abyssals at 96 successes to your 100 successes.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T18:38:31-07:00","id":1399460,"title":"","content":"&quot;Blessed Isle!&quot; West Sparrow yells, turning his head to briefly see <i>something</i> jump out of the water just in time to stop the gunslinger's leap. &quot;What in the <i>hell</i> was that?&quot; Shivering, but still running, he turns back to his task of getting to the ship. Rather than waiting for someone to lower a rope, he continues running, cleanly timing his steps to switch from parallel to the sea to parallel to the ship's hull. &quot;Medic! This man needs a medic!&quot; he shouts, repeating his message until he can bound over the railing and skid to a halt on the deck of the ship. &quot;Please is there a medic on board?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-06T08:49:05-07:00","id":1401351,"title":"","content":"With the grace of a sea dragon, Ethan breaches the surface of the bay, landing lightly on his feet beside West Sparrow. Eyes widening in surprise as a flash lights the air behind him and the master craftsman they'd fought beside crumples to the deck before them.<br /> <br /> &quot;My men will have prepared things to aid Elder,&quot; he tells West Sparrow, helping to lower the old man they'd pulled from the wreckage to a stretcher that a pair of sailors runs out to them even as he speaks.<br /> <br /> &quot;Deba!&quot; He shouts for his first mate. &quot;Prepare to dive, all here are my welcome guests, and we will let the sea wash any other trash off our decks! And you two,&quot; Ethan waves over two deckhands and indicates his new allies, &quot;show these two to the wardroom or infirmary as they desire.&quot;<br /> <br /> Finally, Ethan rushes off to help the Mizuchi make way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25822,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","user":"Mizuchi","date":". 07-06-2020, 12:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-06T08:54:23-07:00","id":1401352,"title":"","content":"Surprised his gamble worked BanFiz looks at the chaos around him. Seeing no immediate danger he slowly picks himself up and tries to clear his head. Stumbling he heads to the entrance to the below decks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-06T16:08:27-07:00","id":1401410,"title":"","content":"The sailors carry the old man below, the saffron-yellow glow around him dying away even as you watch, leaving the most brilliant lights on the ship's deck the anima banners of Ethan and West Sparrow. The men making the ship ready to submerge, stowing gear and furling sails, give both a wide berth. The men have long since learned that the captain's anima can strip flesh from bone if they aren't careful, while West Sparrow receives many wary glances and hears the men whisper &quot;<i>Anathema</i>&quot; to one another.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":74,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","user":"Kyeudo","date":". 07-07-2020, 12:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T20:18:54-07:00","id":1401838,"title":"","content":"Knowing there is nothing he can do about his anima banner except wait for it to fade, West Sparrow ignores the whispers; actions that proved his loyalty to the captain and his ship, would have to be enough to keep the crew from freaking out. &quot;Please show me to the infirmary,&quot; he says as politely as he can to the deckhand. &quot;I'd like to see the Elder.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-12T18:50:52-07:00","id":1402510,"title":"","content":"The infirmary is quite spacious by shipboard standards, but is still crowded with cabinets, drawers, and shelves of equipment and supplies, an examination table, and a handful of berths for the wounded needing constant attention. Already, several marines occupy those berths, bandages covering daiklave wounds suffered at the hands of the Abyssal captain and burns from the fire cannon of the ships that invaded the harbor. The old man lies on the table, someone who must be the ship's doctor standing over him and checking his neck for a pulse. The doctor shakes his head as West Sparrow enters and moves to pull a sheet over the body.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-16T09:42:51-07:00","id":1403108,"title":"","content":"Thinking to himself he needs to do something more If this is the quality of opponents they will face BanFiz begins to imagine a better weapon. Knowing this will take time and resources he doesn't currently have he knows he will have to tart with something smaller. Calling to Ethan he asks, &quot;Do you have a place i can work, I may not be exceptional in a fight but I may be able to make something to help us further.&quot; Are there weapons or tools your men could use?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-17T09:59:41-07:00","id":1403244,"title":"","content":"Ethan responds with a slight bow towards BanFiz. &quot;You know the ships armaments already. This one or my men could certainly use better equipment, though any aid you can render will be accepted.&quot; He waves to a nearby sailor, &quot;Norta, take Senior BanFiz below, and show him the armory and workshop both, and introduce him to Engineer Long who is to provide him with anything he requests.&quot;<br /> <br /> Looking back to BanFiz, his eyes twinkle with a slight smile and the reflected light of the ships burning around them, &quot;And now if you would please clear the deck, I don't believe you can breath underwater?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-17T15:05:34-07:00","id":1403294,"title":"","content":"With a nod to his captain, Norta waved BanFiz through the hatch and sealed it behind him, the last hatch on the deck to receive that treatment.<br /> <br /> Ethan glanced around the deck of the Mizuchi with approval, the squad of marines that was forming up near him (inured as his schoolmates were to his banner, it still was not comfortable) were the only ones left above. There was always at least one squad posted outside the ship when they made way to be absolutely certain no unwelcome guests used the last few moments to make their way aboard. Ethan's satisfaction grew as he felt a rumbling grow beneath his feet, the Mizuchi starting to make way. With a slight lurch, the bow of the ship begins moving forward, and down.<br /> <br /> Even as water laps around his ankles, the captain of the Mizuchi saw a flash of movement, and with a shout and heavy impact the greatcoated Abyssal captain landed only a few meters short of the stern, one of the few areas of the deck not yet flooding with water.<br /> <br /> &quot;Welcome aboard captain, though I'm afraid I won't be inviting you to join us for any refreshments.&quot;<br /> <br /> The woman actually growled, raising her daiklave into a ready position and stalking towards them. In a flash, the marines are formed up around Ethan, the movement around him sending long shadows flickering through the light cast by his anima banner across the now hip high water. She eyes them, but does not stop her approach. &quot;I have little patience for those who deny me.&quot;<br /> <br /> As the woman draws closer Ethan's genial expression hardens. &quot;And I have less for those who prey upon innocents, save for the patience of the hunt. Something tells me we will be seeing one another again, though the circumstances will be vastly different.&quot;<br /> <br /> The rumble that Ethan can feel through the boards underfoot changes tempo. Smirking, Ethan spends a minor effort of will and sends a wave slapping into the Abyssal's angry visage. Without another word, he and his marines let themselves drop into the water, leaving the woman bobbing in the bay above them. Ethan lets his men swim into the airlocks set into the hull first, gripping a handhold against the growing speed of his vessel. A hungry and intent mind brushes his the shadow of a sea serpent flows overhead towards the waters the ship has just departed. Ethan sends back regret and patience, waiting only to see the serpent turn back to follow his course before he slips into the airlock.<br /> <br /> With the pull of a lever, the bulkhead closes, and the water begins to cycle out of the airlock as Ethan, his crew, and their passengers sail underneath the invading forces and out to sea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-21T17:43:45-07:00","id":1403911,"title":"","content":"Norta leads BanFiz down past the gun decks to the orlop deck and through its tight passages to the workshop space amidships. The workshop is well equipped, with a small brick forge in one corner, covered bins of materials, racks of tools, workbenches, and plenty of space to deal with larger projects. Unlike many shipboard workshops, one of the material bunkers is reinforced and padlocked; the label says 'Jade-Steel'. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Here's the workshop,&quot;</span> the sailor explains. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;The armory is on the upper gun deck -we've got firewands, flame pieces, spears, and cutlasses- and the magazine for the tidecutter bolts is in the forward hold. I'll let Long know the captain's orders and send him your way.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-22T21:43:15-07:00","id":1404163,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow slowly walks into the infirmary. Respectfully, he asks the doctor, &quot;Did he say or do anything before he passed?&quot; In his pocket, West rubs his fingers over the cloth the old man had given him. He had hoped the old one would live, and would be able to share his knowledge. Without more information, opposing the female captain and her companions was going to be tricky.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-22T21:54:14-07:00","id":1404167,"title":"","content":"The doctor, a middle-aged sailor with a salt-and-pepper beard, appears startled by the sudden appearance of West Sparrow, glowing as he is with his caste mark upon his brow. <span style=\"color:#EE82EE\">&quot;Um, no, he did not. He never regained consciousness.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-22T22:11:48-07:00","id":1404173,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow sighs. &quot;I tried to be fast, but it was a long way to the ship. Thank you for doing what you could for him.&quot; West turns to walk away, but then has an idea. &quot;Excuse me, sir, but do you have a moment to attempt to answer a question? Or do you have other patients to attend to?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-22T22:27:23-07:00","id":1404175,"title":"","content":"Still seeming uncertain of how to act, the doctor answers <span style=\"color:#EE82EE\">&quot;I do have a moment right now. What is your question?&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-23T20:43:36-07:00","id":1404350,"title":"","content":"&quot;Can you tell me anything about the man? I don't have much information about him. Could you tell how he died, or how old he was, or where he was from, based on what you know of bodies and such?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-23T21:47:06-07:00","id":1404359,"title":"","content":"The doctor shakes his head. <span style=\"color:#EE82EE\">&quot;There's not much I could tell you. My best guess at how he died would be internal bleeding. He took quite a beating and several deep cuts. Someone got him bandaged up a bit, but it would have taken a surgeon to save him.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#EE82EE\">&quot;As for how old he is, it's beyond me. He looks about fifty to me, but with him glowing like that earlier how old he looks might not mean much.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;By his clothes, he might be a tradesman from the Isle, but clothing doesn't mean much.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-24T11:35:35-07:00","id":1404438,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow sighs and nods. &quot;Well, thank you anyway. I know you have much to do, so I will take my leave. Which way to the warroom?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-27T13:28:42-07:00","id":1404968,"title":"","content":"The doctor gives you directions to reach the chart room, up a deck and next to the captain's cabin in the stern. The room isn't large, only enough space for the senior officers and then some, and is mostly bare except for a large map of the Western Ocean hung across one wall and a large cabinet whose top serves as a desk or table for plotting courses. West Sparrow knows from experience that the cabinet will contain scroll cases full of maps for specific areas in greater detail.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":74,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","user":"Kyeudo","date":". 07-29-2020, 09:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-27T15:35:38-07:00","id":1404980,"title":"","content":"BanFiz surveys the layout of the workshop and smiles. After closing the door to ensure he's alone he begins to work. He's movements are quick and precise and within the hour, he has containers of two different powders. One seems to have a slight blue tint while the other is a firey red. This should get us started he thinks, I can make the rest at a more normal pace. He starts again on more of the Water Resistant formula. Ethan and his troops should enjoy this.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Water Resistant Firedust using CNNT<br /> : 10d10x7 <b>8</b><br /> <br /> Impact Explosive Firedust using CNNT<br /> : 10d10x7 <b>7</b><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-29T11:08:59-07:00","id":1405182,"title":"","content":"Dripping dry as he makes his way through the corridors, Ethan pokes his head into the infirmary and grimaces upon seeing the man they'd rescued has already passed. He passes among the wounded, however, exchanging a few words with each, trusting the infirmary's staff to know their business.<br /> <br /> The doctor informs him that West Sparrow headed for the chart room, and Ethan follows him up a deck, and asks a crewman to let BanFiz know where to find them. The Mizuchi is holding position near the bottom of the ocean only a few dozen miles away from the port they fled. It's time to discuss next steps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25822,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","user":"Mizuchi","date":". 08-03-2020, 11:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-29T18:29:59-07:00","id":1405224,"title":"","content":"West nods at Ethan, and then pulls the cloth from the old man out of his pocket. He lays it out on the cabinet top, and starts to examine it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-29T18:34:59-07:00","id":1405226,"title":"","content":"The piece of cloth turns out to be a rough map of an island, with mountains, forests, and a river, drawn with black ink upon the cloth. There are no marks to indicate latitude or longitude, only an X indicating a location on the island somewhere in the mountains and a single word at the top &quot;kataigidas&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-03T08:20:24-07:00","id":1406114,"title":"","content":"Having plied these waters for years, Ethan bends to the map to see if he can place its location. Though he has spent more time under the waves than over it since throwing off his masters' yoke, he begins to match the island's shoreline to all the lands he's seen, whether on parchment or with his own eyes.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> 3 int, 3 sail, 2 stunt, 1 from Fine Passage-Negotiating Style (2 motes)<br /> 8d10x7+1: <b>4</b> [8d10x7=6, 9, 3, 7, 3, 9, 1, 5] (failed the 6 reroll)<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25822,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","user":"Mizuchi","date":". 08-07-2020, 04:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-04T17:59:09-07:00","id":1406357,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow, while young, has years of experience sailing, albeit mostly in the area around the loathsome fishing village his father insisted on inhabiting. He squints up his face in concentration, attempting to jog something useful out of his memories. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Rolling for information about the map: Intelligence 2 + Sail 3 = 5 base dice. Plus 2 for stunt. Spending 4 motes on the Sail excellency to get 4 more dice. Total 11 dice. Results of roll: 7,7,0,5,3,6,3.3,1,1,1 = 4 total successes. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25845,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","user":"Arataya","date":".  Added the spoiler section around the roll. 08-18-2020, 03:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-07T16:00:04-07:00","id":1406851,"title":"","content":"Both Ethan and West Sparrow have heard tale of Kataigidas Island, an island supposedly surrounded by dangerous reefs and a perpetual storm, located somewhere within the region of ocean far to the west known as Sharukan's Triangle. Of course, that stretch of sea itself is fairly mysterious. The area is a haven for pirates and fae and ships have a history of vanishing into the Triangle, perhaps found later as flotsam.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T13:03:49-07:00","id":1408991,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow softly says, &quot;Hmm...why were they willing to kill you for this, old man?&quot; West turns to face Ethan and says, louder, &quot;He told me not to let those ruffians get this. I don't know if he meant the map or what the map leads to. Regardless, it seems that the best way to fulfill his last request is to find out what valuables this map leads to. I cannot do this on my own, Captain.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-24T10:00:05-07:00","id":1410090,"title":"","content":"Deep in his work BanFiz blocks out all distractions. Having not left his island much he has never turned his thoughts to how he could fight if he needed to. His firewand is a great tool but insufficient in a real fight where he must carry his own weight. The new powders though have given him an idea now he just needs to make it work. Vaguely he hears a knocking at the door but nothing can interrupt the work so he ignores it.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/841207\" target=\"_blank\">Red Firedust</a>: <a href=\"https://10d10x7\" target=\"_blank\">10d10x7</a> <b>5</b><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/841208\" target=\"_blank\">Blue Firedust</a>: <a href=\"https://10d10x7\" target=\"_blank\">10d10x7</a> <b>7</b><br /> <br /> Double 8's Double 9's<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/841209\" target=\"_blank\">Grenades</a>: <a href=\"https://10d10u7\" target=\"_blank\">10d10u7</a> <b>7</b><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25821,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","user":"Magesrook","date":". 08-24-2020, 02:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-25T10:07:57-07:00","id":1410321,"title":"","content":"&quot;I certainly don't intend to let those scum of the sea gain whatever treasures lie at the end of this path,&quot; Ethan says, looking at the map. Meeting West Sparrow's eyes, he continues. &quot;These waters are my home, however. I must ask, what drives you to drop everything to aid a stranger and chase shadows such as these beyond his death?&quot;<br /> <br /> He's interacted with the venerable BanFiz often enough it's no surprise the elder craftsman has yet to join them; he certainly won't be one to rush the man away from whatever project the master has undertaken. The flamboyant young man before him, however, is an unknown.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-25T13:12:17-07:00","id":1410377,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, umm...a few things, I guess.&quot; West Sparrow says, scratches his head thoughtfully. &quot;I kind of promised the old man I would get him to safety, and I...failed...I guess I figure the next best thing is to make sure the thing he was protecting is safe.&quot; He pauses, uncertain of how much to tell the Captain, who is as much a stranger to him as West Sparrow is unknown. &quot;I want to find a purpose, I guess, something better than fishing in that crummy little village like my father.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-26T15:21:26-07:00","id":1410576,"title":"","content":"&quot;Fair enough. I was given a purpose when I awoke to the power to break the chains that bound me, but it was one I would have chosen for myself... However, protecting your crew, and hunting slavers and pirates might not be your choice.&quot; Ethan shrugged. &quot;Honoring a broken vow seems a good start. As for me,&quot; he gives a feral grin, &quot;I rarely need extra motivation to go on a hunt.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-31T13:41:54-07:00","id":1411243,"title":"","content":"With a flicker of will, Ethan sends his intent to his shoal, and the deck beneath their feet begins to rumble once again, the Mizuchi heading further out to sea. A moment later, the navigator knocks and enters the chartroom.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes captain?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;We're to sail to Kataigidas Island,&quot; Ethan tells him, motioning to the map he and West Sparrow had been perusing. &quot;If you can guide us better than 'head west for the Triangle', I'll call it a win.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes sir,&quot; the sailor responds, and gets to work digging into the drawers of charts.<br /> <br /> Ethan turns back to West Sparrow. &quot;We'll send a diver up to spot for us once a glass, but should be able to sail un-pursued under the surface wherever our destination. Do you have any objection to seeing to the man's unfinished business immediately?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-31T14:10:44-07:00","id":1411249,"title":"","content":"The navigator pulls out four rolls of parchment from the scroll cases inside the cabinet and lays them out on the chart table.The four maps bracket a region south-southeast of Wavecrest, showing some of the islands along the sides of Sharukan's Triangle. At the far southern point of the triangle is Sharukan's Pillar, the column of rock that gives the region its name and the supposed lair of a sea god. The westernmost point is Songcatcher Island, marked on the chart with warnings about fae, while a small cluster of islands called the Wheua Islands makes the northernmost point of the triangle and the chart has markings indicating unfriendly natives. Other marking along the edges of the triangle mention pirate sightings, dangerous reefs, and sea monsters. The four charts, however, don't cover the triangles interior, an obvious lacuna in the navigational information.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-04T19:52:46-07:00","id":1411990,"title":"","content":"&quot;Indeed, I do not, Captain.&quot; West Sparrow replies with a grin. &quot;In fact, I would have protested had this not been your plan.&quot; West leans over the charts, examining them closely. &quot;Heh. It appears that Creation might already be doing its best to keep Kataigidas Island safe. I hope your excellent ship and its clever design are enough to avoid most of the trouble.&quot; West sighs a little. &quot;I will miss feeling the wind in the sails.&quot; He pauses, realizing that he never cared that much about the wind before, and then touches his recently-acquired sword. <i>Breezedancer</i> he thinks. <i>Perhaps it is you who is actually missing the winds.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-11T11:13:48-07:00","id":1413062,"title":"","content":"&quot;If you truly miss the surface that much, we can on occasion ride the surface; or you could join my shoal and swim up there yourself?&quot; Ethan smiles and winks, showing a flash of too sharp teeth.<br /> <br /> Looking back to look at the charts, he taps table in thought... &quot;I'm trying to think of anywhere we might go for a better set of charts, though for the Triangle such a chart would be rare and suspect at best... Perhaps from the natives...&quot; he trails off.<br /> <br /> Turning to the navigator, he asks, &quot;Brute force isn't always a bad thing. How long would it take the Mizuchi to quarter the triangle for our ghost island?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-11T12:20:50-07:00","id":1413077,"title":"","content":"The navigator does some measuring, adjusts for the differences in scale of the charts, and a quick calculation. <span style=\"color:#8B4513\">&quot;It will take us just under eight days to get us to the Triangle if we stay submerged, half that if we surface and spread the sails. Once there, it should only take us two days to quarter the area.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-21T12:09:47-07:00","id":1414948,"title":"","content":"Six days later, as you surface at sundown, the easternmost islands of Sharukan's Triangle are just visible on the horizon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-21T12:31:30-07:00","id":1414949,"title":"","content":"Ethan sends runners to locate both Banfiz and West Sparrow and invite them to the deck to take in the breeze and the last of the day's light. It's time to decide just how to search for their lost island.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-25T19:52:23-07:00","id":1415499,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow quickly heads for the deck, happy to be out of the confines of below deck. &quot;Hail, Ethan!&quot; West Sparrow smiles as he approaches the captain. &quot;I assume those bumps on the horizon mark the start of the mystical Triangle?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-07T07:27:51-07:00","id":1417141,"title":"","content":"Unaware of everything happening up top BanFiz continues to work away. He calls the sailor and asks him to bring him all the gear in need of repair, if they are going to be sailing for some time he might as well make sure everything in in perfect working order. That may be important if they keep being followed. Losing himself in the work only pausing to eat and sleep the pile of gear is quickly returned to working order and removed. Verifying they will still be sailing for several more days he returns to crafting dust and his throw-able weapons. They will be needed far too soon he fears. The work though has become rote already so he starts to think of what can he do next. After the projects are complete he begins to sketch an idea for how to use the new powders to build a better firewand has come to him. When the runner knocks he stows the sketches and follows him above the deck catching the end of Sparrows words. &quot;The Triangle eh this could be interesting.&quot; he mutters as he wanders over to the two.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Repairs<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/852778\" target=\"_blank\">Repairs</a>: <b>12#12d10x7</b> <b>10</b> <b>5</b> <b>3</b> <b>6</b> <b>7</b> <b>6</b> <b>5</b> <b>11</b> <b>7</b> <b>8</b> <b>6</b> <b>5</b><br /> <br /> Powder<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/852779\" target=\"_blank\">Powder</a>: <b>8#12d10x7</b> <b>8</b> <b>7</b> <b>7</b> <b>9</b> <b>5</b> <b>6</b> <b>3</b> <b>10</b><br /> <br /> Grenades<br /> Double 9's<br /> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/852781\" target=\"_blank\">Grenades</a>: <b>6#12d10x7</b> <b>6</b> <b>12</b> <b>9</b> <b>6</b> <b>7</b> <b>7</b><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-08T18:47:32-07:00","id":1417406,"title":"","content":"&quot;Welcome to the Triangle,&quot; Ethan says, waving a hand broadly over the horizon. &quot;With no false modesty, my knowledge of these waters ended leagues ago. However I have no doubt this ship and her crew can find what we seek. I was hoping you might have a better idea than 'survey every blot on the horizon', as that is the best I have for the moment.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-13T13:12:35-07:00","id":1418083,"title":"","content":"BanFiz looks out over the water, while no stranger to the practice this view is far different than what he's used to from his island. Catching Eathans question he replies, &quot;Checking the blots will possibly work but we run the risk of missing something. Quartering is the better option but if it has remained hidden this long it probably lies neared the middle. we may want to set a grid on the map but ignore the outer squares.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T15:44:56-07:00","id":1419252,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow nods. &quot;Seems a reasonable enough thought process. How fast can your...shoal? swim, Captain? Perhaps they can give us an accurate idea of the coastline faster than the ship could sail around it? That would mean we don't have to divert the ship's course to the middle of the triangle, while still being able to perform at least a cursory check of every island we pass?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-13T11:03:07-08:00","id":1432098,"title":"","content":"&quot;I don't think I'd want to send them too far afield, but between my crew and Mizuchi, we should be able to speed up our surveys a bit.&quot; Ethan rubs his chin in thought. &quot;Some accurate and up to date charts of this region would be worth quite a bit, come to think of it. It'd take a bit longer than just speeding by anything we find, but if we spend some more time surveying we'd be less likely to miss our target.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-14T10:39:02-08:00","id":1432223,"title":"","content":"BanFiz nods his head thoughtfully to Ethans response. After a few moments of though he responds. &quot;While the is something to be said about a thorough search my fear becomes our foes will not give us that leisure.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-14T20:48:17-08:00","id":1432278,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yes, we have to find a balance between thoroughness and speed.&quot; West Sparrow says, completely agreeing with BanFiz's assessment. &quot;Let us quarter the area, and use your crew and familiar to search more thoroughly than a simple survey as we sail by.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-15T14:17:23-08:00","id":1432341,"title":"","content":"Small teams are dispatched to survey the nearby islands, while Mizuchi is sent to prowl the coasts and look for anything that might point the ship in the right direction. Hours later, Mizuchi is the first to return, indicating she has found a city to the southwest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T07:55:58-08:00","id":1432787,"title":"","content":"Ethan, in communion with Mizuchi, seeks to discover if the city carried any of the same feeling as the raiders they so recently fought, and then sets out to find BanFiz and West Sparrow to share the discovery.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T10:28:18-08:00","id":1432799,"title":"","content":"Mizuchi conveys vacancy and depth - the city is flooded and she detected no humans there, with only the tops of the taller buildings breaking the surface for seabirds to nest in. She also conveys a sense of age. The buildings are encrusted with barnacles and corals - whatever disaster befell the city happened long ago.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T13:41:48-08:00","id":1432828,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well,&quot; Ethan tells BanFiz and West Sparrow, &quot;I think it may be worth diverting to the ruins; even if they aren't our target, they may have charts of some sort to help us find this island. Do either of you have an idea of what this city may once have been?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T18:10:09-08:00","id":1432867,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hmmm...&quot; West Sparrow raises his eyebrows. &quot;Odds seem long that we'll find useable charts in a long abandoned, flooded city. Still, there might be something of value in there...&quot; He trails off, focusing on remembering the tales he's heard of the islands in Sharukan's Triangle. &quot;I've been listening to sailors tell stories of the seas since before I could walk. Let me see if I can remember any about a flooded city...&quot;<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Rolling Intelligence + Sail, plus my stunt dice. 2 + 3 + 2 = 7 total dice Roll results: 1,1,2,5,6,9,0 = 3 total successes </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25845,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","user":"Arataya","date":".  I failed at math and thought I had 5 dice, but I actually had 7. Not that it mattered... 01-20-2021, 10:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-21T20:02:06-08:00","id":1433000,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> While West Sparrow has heard stories of sailors coming across sunken cities, cities and whole islands being dragged beneath the waves by acts of sorcery or divine wrath, and the like, he can't say he's heard of one that was supposedly contained within Sharukan's Triangle.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-25T16:49:44-08:00","id":1433430,"title":"","content":"It does sound promising I think its worth our time.&quot;, states BanFiz stroking his beard. &quot;Not all maps are paper after all they could have tablets that could be used to update our maps. Some lands have stone tables with maps of the entire kingdom.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-02T15:16:56-08:00","id":1434302,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow replies, &quot;Perhaps we should send a small group to go investigate? I feel that our speed is essential to our success at protecting whatever it is the old man didn't want those fiends to find. I think that <i>if</i> we found a map, that would speed us along, but if we don't, we'll have wasted time. So perhaps some of us go look while the ship continues surveying the islands?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-03T08:44:09-08:00","id":1434387,"title":"","content":"&quot;It seems to be a good move,&quot; Ethan agrees. &quot;You said 'some of us' should look -- you might find it hard to keep up with my shoal in the water. We do have some small launches aboard, though I can also induct you if you'd like to gain some advantage in the sea?&quot; He pulls a lapel on his uniform to better expose subtle gills.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-03T17:51:17-08:00","id":1434441,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow's eyes widen. He knows of magic, of course, but he didn't realize the captain had access to any. &quot;What does being inducted entail, exactly? Also, I didn't necessarily mean I should be part of the group that goes, though I do love a good adventure. It sounds like you want to stay with your ship, Captain? What about you, BanFiz? Do you want to go explore the city?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-05T10:51:53-08:00","id":1434624,"title":"","content":"&quot;Storms no,&quot; Ethan shakes his head. &quot;My second can watch the ship, and I love an adventure! As for your question, my crew and I have something of a pact. Our bond lets us share many of the benefits Mizuchi has from breathing underwater and improved swimming to natural defenses. You only need partake of a bit of my blood.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-05T17:39:18-08:00","id":1434652,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hmm...&quot; West Sparrow ponders for a moment. &quot;This seems to be a great boon, not granted to just anyone. What are you expecting in return? I cannot provide any coins; I left nearly all I had with the temple I scaled at our last port.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-10T09:50:58-08:00","id":1435082,"title":"","content":"BanFiz lost in thought snaps, suddenly realizes his name has been called. Quickly reviewing the conversation in his head, he smiles and replies. &quot;I've done what I can to bolster the defenses of the ship and I have some new toys to play with. I think Ethan probably would prefer I test these somewhere not on his ship.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-10T14:23:02-08:00","id":1439033,"title":"","content":"&quot;As to your question West Sparrow, I only ask my men for their loyalty and service. As we are working towards the same ends, I would only ask that you not work against the good of this ship and crew. If ever you find you cannot agree with me and mine, I'll release you from the bond at your request. Though I hope I've shown myself trustworthy.&quot;<br /> <br /> Ethan turns to BanFiz. &quot;As for your toys, I would love to play with them. Could we take them with us to this ruin? The offer I've made to West Sparrow is open to you as well.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-11T19:00:32-08:00","id":1439341,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow ponders for a few minutes. Ethan, so far, has been a good fighter and a good host. West's long term goal is to have his own ship, but learning from this magical captain would probably only further his goal. And considering the dangers of the ocean, being better equipped to handle himself in the water seems to only be an advantage. &quot;I accept your offer, Captain.&quot; he says, nodding his head in a small bow of gratitude for the generous terms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-30T09:22:25-07:00","id":1442047,"title":"","content":"&quot;Excellent!&quot; Ethan waves over a sailor, who sets a tray with a heavy cup, several small glasses, a rag, and a bottle on the table before them. Taking up the bottle, Ethan pours a clear liquid into several of the glasses.<br /> <br /> &quot;Rice wine -- you'll find that blood is something of an acquired taste, and this helps to keep it down. It also makes the itching a bit more bearable after.&quot;<br /> <br /> Untying the shirt cuff from his wrist, Ethan pushes the sleeve back towards his elbow exposing his forearm, the underside thick with scars. With quick motions, smooth with familiarity, he unsheathes his belt knife and draws it across the previous scars, letting the blood fall into the cup until it nears the brim. Then, holding the rag tight to his arm he turns to his companions.<br /> <br /> &quot;We stand on little ceremony here. Once you have partaken of my blood, offered freely, the magic will take hold and adapt your body. I recommend one or two glasses of wine, a deep drink from the cup, and then the wine. It shouldn't take long; but we can spare a few hours until you've grown used to the changes.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Ethan casts One Through Blood:<br /> * spends 1 lethal health level, and unsure if I need to commit additional motes with the battle group I already have committed?<br /> * <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/12dmBeh6R10_Oh8BG7jEXlhJK3PWJvQONyxqwV88b5E0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> * Effected individuals gain the benefits of Deep Seas Element, Salt-Slicked Scales, and Hook Fang Jaws<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-07T22:03:04-07:00","id":1443083,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow gulps. His idea of &quot;partaking of blood&quot; was a few drops, not a mouthful. Still, Ethan was <i>actively bleeding</i> to provide this benefit, so it would be extremely rude to refuse now. West eagerly downs two shots of the rice wine, and then, more gingerly, raises the goblet of blood to his face. After a moment of dread, he raises the cup in a toast. &quot;To your health, good Captain,&quot; he says with gusto, and chugs a single mouthful of the blood. Grimacing at the taste, he immediately downs another two shots of the rice wine. Unsure what to expect while the changes take place, he finds a corner of the deck to sit down in, where he will be out of the way while the magic overtakes his body.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-20T10:10:31-07:00","id":1444848,"title":"","content":"&quot;Fascinating!&quot;, Banfiz exclaims &quot;I simply must see this ritual and of course test it on myself.&quot; Taking the cup from Sparrow he forgoes the rice wine and takes two long swallows. &quot;Hmm it takes like liquid liver fascinating. No win though, I can't do a proper study if you dull your senses with wine.&quot; Sitting down with a view of Sparrow he pulls out a notebook to take notes of the process in them both.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-22T00:41:50-07:00","id":1445237,"title":"","content":"Several hours later, the lookout sights the first spire breaking the water. As you grow nearer, you can hear the calls of the gulls nesting in the carvings covering the pale gold stone. Dozens of pinnacles rise from the waves to varying heights, some towering above the Mizuchi's mast, covered with bas relief iconography depicting the sun, moon, and stars.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-22T09:34:18-07:00","id":1445279,"title":"","content":"&quot;Spectacular!&quot; Banfiz exclaims jumping up. Used to talking out loud to himself while working he doesn't realize he's said this loud enough for any near by to hear. Sitting back down he begins to sketch down the designs and patterns these could come in useful down the road after all. As he draws he mutters to himself. &quot;So much so much and I just can't get it all. No one told me it would be so interesting. I should have brought Gelb and his team, send them up the spire. Have them take charcoal rubbings more exact than this drawing.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25821,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","user":"Magesrook","date":". 04-22-2021, 12:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-10T18:43:20-07:00","id":1448183,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow is startled by Banfiz's exclamation. For the last 1/2 hour or so, he's been touching at the subtle gills on his neck, as well as playing with the distinct webbing between his fingers and toes. (His shoes lie forgotten on the deck, wrenched off during the transformation.) He's also blinking often, fascinated by the almost transparent second eyelids he has developed. Like when you bite your cheek and your tongue can't leave the wound alone, West Sparrow's fingers keep going back to the changes. In fact, his tongue is busy moving over his new fangs, while his other hand touches at the spines on his elbows and wrists. But after Banfiz's excitement, he refocuses on the wider world. The spires are indeed a sight to behold. Still, with no knowledge of what the symbols might mean, Sparrow is much more keen to explore the underwater part of the city. Figuring that it's been long enough that the alcohol is out of his system enough to not impair his swimming abilities (especially with the enhancements), he jumps on the railing, and then with a whoop, dives cleanly into the water and heads for the spires. He marvels at the lack of burning in his lungs as he stays under the water for double what he used to, and how much faster he feels in the water. He can also see clearly, even with the reduced light as it is filtered through the water.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25845,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","user":"Arataya","date":". 05-10-2021, 09:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-11T22:36:07-07:00","id":1448300,"title":"","content":"Beneath the waves, the buildings continue down into the gloom. Hundreds of other buildings, their spires not tall enough to break the surface, spread out around you, all of varied heights. Corals, sponges, barnacles, kelp, sea grasses, and more cluster upon the buildings, almost hiding the pale gold stone of the upper floors behind decades of growth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-18T15:43:43-07:00","id":1448903,"title":"","content":"&quot;Now that we are here,&quot; says Ethan as he steps to the railing, &quot;it would seem we ought to to a quick reconnaissance to see if there are any better charts of the area to find our mystery island.&quot; He eyes his familiar swimming under the surface nearer to the buildings, attempting to gauge whether she has detected any threats that remain unseen to him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25822-mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-18T15:47:15-07:00","id":1448904,"title":"","content":"Mizuchi conveys calm - she hasn't detected anything threatening nor as large as herself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-18T16:29:46-07:00","id":1448913,"title":"","content":"BanFiz mumbles to himself as he finishes trying to take notes. &quot;This webbing certainly makes this more difficult. If I have gills why can I breathe above water they are for filtering underneath. Will this now make me an expert swimmer?&quot; Realizing everyone has again left him alone he frowns and stows his not book away. Sighing he say outload but not realizing it. &quot;All ways the impatience of youth always hurry scurry when there are things to looking at documented.&quot; Waddling over to the railing he drops a couple grenades in the water to make sure the water won't cause them to explode accidently.<br /> <br /> Watching them splash harmlessly into the water he dives in after them. No sense wasting them If I can help it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25821,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","user":"Magesrook","date":". 05-18-2021, 07:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-02T16:14:04-07:00","id":1450742,"title":"","content":"West Sparrow heads towards the building with the tallest, biggest spires. He figures that it might be a palace, and the ruler would probably have had maps (or treasure) that could be helpful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T11:21:07-07:00","id":1451880,"title":"","content":"The biggest building is a single tower twice as big around as the others, it's top reaching above the water. The tower isn't round or square like most of the others, but appears to be a hexagram in cross section. Each floor is defined by an arched window, at least twice as tall as a man, located in the center of each section of wall, except for the top floor, where each point of the star is a balcony, each meeting in a wide archway at the hexagonal center of the tower, supporting the spire on delicate-looking arches. A spiral staircase in the center provides access to the interior of the tower. All of the towers windows appear to be intact, with a stained glass insert at the top of each window depicting a sunburst. The bottom of the tower remains shrouded by the darkness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":74,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","user":"Kyeudo","date":". 06-12-2021, 07:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-15T21:40:16-07:00","id":1452414,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hmmm....fancy!&quot; West Sparrow thinks. He likes the look of the hexagram building, but his thief's instincts kick in. &quot;Magic is probably afoot; what with how intact it is, while all around there are corals and other underwater things growing on the other buildings.&quot; Hmmm....he draws closer slowly, hoping that his new abilities will help him notice anything dangerous before he is caught in a trap.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25845-arataya","name":"Arataya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-06T19:58:56-07:00","id":1454411,"title":"","content":"Muttering to himself as he swims towards West Sparrow. These young kids and their rushing around. This is how things get broken before we know what's happening. &quot;Slow down there this is a treasure we need to keep track of where everything is placed in case we need to know later.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25821-magesrook","name":"Magesrook","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-22T08:30:23-07:00","id":1534557,"title":"","content":"(After a long hiatus, this game has restarted. To accommodate real life better, the game was moved to Discord. Transcribing it here as a story archive.)<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">West Sparrow keeps drawing closer to the oddly intact hexagram tower, headed toward the nearest stained glass window. He\u2019s looking for traps before just going through the archway under the glass.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#2980b9\">Banfiz, lost in his study of the reliefs, does not notice that Sparrow has left the group. He is hyper focused and unlikely to notice without someone specifically calling him. While this does make him vulnerable, he has forgotten there may be dangers to this mission.</span><br /> <br /> The nearest window, looking in on the floor just below the balconies, shows what appears to have once been an office. The room contains waterlogged, decaying cabinets, shelves, and furniture, including what appears to have once been a desk. The sea life encrusting the exterior of the tower is not as thick inside, thinning out further in the darker corners of the room. Two open doorways inside the office show gloomy rooms beyond, but any details of the interior are too difficult to make out from the window. West Sparrow doesn't notice any dangers lurking around the archways on the balcony floor, though he does startle several small fish as he swims closer. Within, you can see that the stairwell goes down as far as you can see, with a circular space in the center allowing you to see landings and a railed walkway at each floor.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">West Sparrow goes through the archway and starts investigating the office, paying particular attention to the desk.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#27ae60\">&quot;Don't get too distracted friend,&quot; Ethan says as he passes Banfiz, following West Sparrow to the office. &quot;We are here for a purpose, though there will likely be time for study if we're successful.&quot; Ethan directs a few of his men to do a brief survey of the floors beneath the waves, before turning to aid West Sparrow's investigation.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#2980b9\">&quot;Huh? What? Oh I see. Young ones so eager to see the new they miss the old. Well, needs must as they say.&quot; He disgruntledly follows the others into the building</span><br /> <br /> Descending to the next floor, you see that doors and hallways lead off from the walkway circling the stairwell. Rotted scraps on the floor show that once they were once carpeted. Elegant fixtures mounted high on the walls would have provided light. Finding the hallway that leads to the office is not difficult, proving to be one of the rooms you glimpsed from outside. The other opens to what was once a parlor or sitting room, judging by the wreckage of couches and chairs. Several pedestals arranged along the wall display sculptures: a marble bust, a sinuous green dragon, a tarnished silver tree, and a pair of polished wooden dancers, miraculously preserved.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">West Sparrow glances into the sitting room. The treasures on the wall are interesting, but not immediately so. None of them are maps. He heads into the office, determined to search every drawer and cabinet for signs of maps and/or this building\u2019s former purpose.</span><br /> <br /> Choosing a likely looking cabinet as a place to start, West Sparrow pulls open the door. The sudden disturbance causes the cabinet to break from the wall, falling down on the swashbuckler.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Feeling the water churning, West Sparrow throws himself to the side, hoping to avoid being pinned under the cabinet.</span><br /> <br /> West Sparrow gets clear of the cabinet before it crashes to the ground, where the cabinet crumbles a bit under its own weight.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#27ae60\">Seeing at a glance that West Sparrow is fine, Ethan checks to see if the cabinet contained anything worthwhile.</span><br /> <br /> The cabinet's wreckage is empty.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#2980b9\">Banfiz, upon entering the room, did not notice the cabinet but was rather more interested in the sculptures, particularly the dragon, and begins to investigate it. Using his knowledge of crafting to determine the maker and time period and possibly take it with him for inspiration</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#2980b9\">Hearing the large crash from the other room Banfiz just shakes his head and goes back to his study.</span><br /> <br /> You believe the dragon, which is made of verdigrised copper, is the work of a renowned sculptor from the pre-Shogunate period, Nifuji the Eight Fingered. That puts the piece as more than two thousand years old.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#2980b9\">&quot;Excellent, excellent. Must add this to the collection. The things I can learn from this!&quot; He puts it in one of his pockets as he continues to look at the other sculptures.</span><br /> <br /> The bust is of a middle-aged woman with long hair wearing a simple tiara. She has high cheekbones and an aquiline nose and her expression is stern. On her brow, lightly engraved, is a full circle. The tree is a replica of a bonsai, each twist of the trunk and each tiny leaf captured in exquisite detail. The pair of dancers are in a flowing, more abstract style, almost seeming to spin about one another as you watch. The wood is a warm, golden brown and seems untouched by time spent underwater, in stark contrast to the furniture around you.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Having successfully dodged the cabinet, West Sparrow metaphorically dusts himself off, and starts looking through the office furniture again, albeit with an added measure of caution.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#27ae60\">Disappointed that the broken cabinet held no valuables, Ethan joins the search in earnest, digging around the office with a bit more abandon than West Sparrow. Notwithstanding his own antics, Ethan gives a few hand signals to a waiting marine to have the rest of the shoal go a bit slower in their search. Hopefully the water will not have consumed anything of note, but haste now after all these years will not help.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#2980b9\">Banfiz, admiring the dancers, finds the illusion of movement fascinating and somehow manages to store it away without noticing he has done so. He thinks to himself &quot;I should show this tree to the others as this is the pinnacle of art&quot; and picks it up and holds it with his left hand. While calling out to the others to come look at the beautiful tree, his right hand is drawn to the circle on the busts forehead and he slowly traces it counterclockwise with his finger.</span><br /> <br /> Nothing happens when you touch the bust.<br /> <br /> Ethan and West Sparrow's search of the room doesn't turn up much. The wood of the shelves, cabinets, and furniture is just as decayed and waterlogged as the cabinet that fell and any papers that might have been contained within have long since rotted away. The search isn't entirely fruitless. Inside the desk's drawers, you find an intact seal stamp and a writing brush with silver bristles.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Not expecting much, as he\u2019s not that well traveled or learned, but hoping his luck is turning, West Sparrow examines the seal stamp to try to identify the former owner.</span><br /> <br /> The stamp plate is blank.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#2980b9\">Having finished his art appreciation with his pockets a little fuller, Banfiz goes to find everyone else.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Frustrated, West Sparrow \u201ctosses\u201d the stamp away, and swims out of the office. He heads to the other room, intending to examine the treasures he saw in the other room. He rolls his eyes when he sees that Banfiz has already pocketed nearly all of them. He taps Banfiz on the shoulder and points at the surface, then opens and closes his mouth, trying to get Banfiz to agree to go to the surface so they can talk without resorting to mime.</span><br /> <br /> One of Ethan's marines returns, giving a series of hand signals: No enemies spotted, no treasure, proceeding down.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#2980b9\">Banfiz looks at West Sparrow, looks to inhale a lot, and says &quot;We are breathing under water. This means we are still oxygenating our lungs and can talk like normal, though it will be muffled.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">West Sparrow pauses, breathes in extra, and says \u201coh, I see. Ok then.\u201d He takes another big breath and continues, \u201cso what did you find? My search came up with nothing helpful.\u201d</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#27ae60\">&quot;Unless Banfiz has other insights, I think we might try our luck deeper. Perhaps there will be more in the harder to reach areas, or at the bottom of the spire, especially if this ruin sank quickly,&quot; Ethan adds.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#2980b9\">&quot;I have nothing more to see on this floor so, yes, let us proceed&quot;</span><br /> <br /> As you proceed downward, searching each floor with Ethan's shoal, you begin to get a general idea of the tower's layout. The uppermost floors seem to be luxury apartments, with offices, sitting rooms, bed chambers, and so on. As with that first office, much of the furnishings are ruined and rotting. The surviving furniture is mostly stone, such as marble display pedestals, vases, or porcelain wash basins. Here and there are pieces that look nearly pristine despite their age, like a wooden dining table and matching chairs. Going further down, the levels are smaller apartments. Here there are fewer pieces of intact furniture and less evidence of decorations. At this depth, the water is noticeably colder and the light is growing dim. Without your new adaptations, it would be very difficult to see. Just when you think you might be exploring an ancient apartment complex, the levels even further down contain large dormitories, public baths, blocks of single rooms, and workspaces of various sizes. Then you find something very interesting. The next room you explore is a large library. Despite being completely flooded, the room is filled with intact shelves, stocked with books. The shelves and the books appear to be completely dry.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">West Sparrow, having been metaphorically burned earlier, is hesitant to touch the books, but on the other hand, this has been the best chance of a map they\u2019ve had all day, so he swims toward the nearest shelf, draws Breezedancer, and gently pokes at the nearest book with the duller side of the sword tip.</span><br /> <br /> Nothing happens<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">West Sparrow sheaths his sword, and then grabs a book with his bare hand, attempting to remove it from the shelf.</span><br /> <br /> The book comes away as easily as from any other shelf. As soon as it leaves the shelf, the pages begin soaking up the surrounding seawater.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">West Sparrow hurriedly puts it back, not wanting to damage anything.</span><br /> <br /> The book dries instantly, though the wrinkles of water damage on the visible page edges and a crust of salt scale on the cover remains.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}